5 Gerry __________ get a lift with Pete to the cinema.
6 Gerry __________ drive to the cinema.','[{"number": 3, "type": "填空题", "content": "Read the text and complete the sentences below with will, won''t, may or might. Sometimes more than one answer is possible.\nGerry is going to the cinema this ','',NULL,0,NULL,'2d5da6845dd0490ba152b960b872a91f','',0.0,0.0);
